# Agent / assistant working directories.
# `.cursor/` is deliberately NOT ignored wholesale: this project's own wiki lives at
# `.cursor/documents/` and is versioned with the code, so it travels with the fork rather than
# existing on one machine. The `.cursor/*` form (not `.cursor/`) is required — git cannot re-include
# anything from inside an excluded directory, so a negation under a bare `.cursor/` silently does
# nothing. Everything else here stays ignored: hooks, tools and scratch.
.cursor/*
!.cursor/README.md
!.cursor/documents/
.playwright-cli/
.zcode/
.codex/
.opencode/
.claude
*.bun-build
